        "notes": "## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Items:\n- [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) - Basic item for Cooldown Reduction and Weapon Power.\n- [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) - Grab this for more Weapon Power. \ufe0f\u2757If you don't have enough cash, grab [Farsight Focus Sash](item_103e6d35-a71f-48c7-b7b9-b89efae62242) and/or green item(s) from last round.\u2757\n\n---\n\n## \u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83e\ude79 Survivability\nPick a survival item instead of [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) **only if certain heroes are being annoying**.\n- [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) - For general increased survivability.\n- [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) - If enemy team has Mei, Cassidy, Ashe, Ana, etc.\n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) - if enemy team had Genji on \"Melee\" build.\n\n\ufe0f\ud83d\udccc Keep this item onward, or at least until you think you don't need it anymore. You might need to give up an essential item, but it is more important to stay alive.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfae Playstyle\nYou should have 20-25% Weapon Power, so now you could focus a bit more on damage.",
