        "notes": "## \ud83d\udca5 Powers\n [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) increases survivability for yourself and allies. This Power will prove to make more impact in future rounds.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Items\n- [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) - Very essential for Cooldown Reduction. \u2757If you don't have enough cash, grab [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) or [Farsight Focus Sash](item_103e6d35-a71f-48c7-b7b9-b89efae62242), and/or green item(s) instead.\u2757\n\n---\n\n## \u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83e\ude79 Survivability\n\ud83d\udccc Only if *absolutely* necessary. Sacrifice [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) if needed.\n\nGeneral:\n- [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) - For increased survivability.\n\nAgainst certain annoying heroes:\n- [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) - Against Mei, Cassidy, Ashe, Ana, etc.\n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) - Against Genji on \"Melee\" build.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfae Playstyle\nWith [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) and decreased cooldowns, you can apply pressure with your kunais by spamming choke points or in the enemy's general direction while supporting team with Suzus and clone's healing.",
