        "notes": "## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Items\n- [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) - Gives allies 100 Overhealth with Suzu. Even though it gives Ability Power instead of Weapon Power, the item provides more survivability in case of emergencies, especially with two Suzus.\u2757If you don't have enough cash, pick [Farsight Focus Sash](item_103e6d35-a71f-48c7-b7b9-b89efae62242) or [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a).\u2757\n\n---\n\n## \u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83e\ude79 Survivability\n\ud83d\udccc Only if *absolutely* necessary. Sacrifice [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) if needed.\n\nGeneral:\n- [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) - For increased survivability.\n- [Goddess\u2019s Aura](item_a36d46c8-cee0-4c97-b6e4-72bb816c13dc) - If you want more survivability when you teleport.\n\nAgainst certain annoying heroes:\n- [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) - Against Mei, Cassidy, Ashe, Ana, etc.\n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) - Against Genji on \"Melee\" build.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfae Playstyle\nUse your two Suzus wisely, especially now that they can provide Overhealth. Maybe go for backline pressure if you have a DPS with you. It's okay to be a bit more aggressive at this point (if it's working).",
