        "notes": "## \ud83d\udca5 Powers\n [Foxy Fireworks](item_d29ac7bb-d84c-44d7-8944-24c9b668b657) helps you deal more damage as the first three kunais explodes upon contact, so you should try your best to make use of it. You could maybe reload often to use them as much as possible.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Items\n[Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) is the most safe option, but you have two other purple items to choose from:\n- [Spirits\u2019 Guidance](item_25513335-271e-402b-bd03-9d082a281c40) - If you are doing well with damage and want faster heals at the same time.\n- [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) - If you want to deal more damage or get more Weapon Power.\n\n\u2757If you don't have enough cash for a purple item above, pick [Farsight Focus Sash](item_103e6d35-a71f-48c7-b7b9-b89efae62242) or [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) instead.\n\n---\n\n## \u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83e\ude79 Survivability\n\ud83d\udccc Only if *absolutely* necessary. Sacrifice [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) if needed.\n\nGeneral:\n- [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) - For increased survivability.\n\nAgainst certain annoying heroes:\n- [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) - Against Mei, Cassidy, Ashe, Ana, etc.\n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) - Against Genji on \"Melee\" build.",
