        "notes": "## \ud83d\udca5 Powers\n [Triple Threat](item_fc0e3d9a-5315-41c2-9aa4-331becace714) increases damage potential. But if your team is struggling and need more healing, grab [Leaf on the Wind](item_b64de259-d122-407d-a7e4-9d7267310704) instead.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Items\n- [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f)\n- [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)\n- [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718)\n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)\n- [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)\n- [Spirits\u2019 Guidance](item_25513335-271e-402b-bd03-9d082a281c40)\n\nYour final build should be these five purple items and one blue item, but of course you could make changes according to your situation. But if you want more survivability, look at options below.\n\n---\n\n## \u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83e\ude79 Survivability\n\ud83d\udccc Only if *absolutely* necessary. Sacrifice [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) if needed.\n\nGeneral:\n- [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) - Gives only slight increase in survivability, but includes Cooldown Reduction to compensate.\n- [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) - To gain Overhealth at low HP once per life.\n- [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) - To gain Damage Reduction at low HP.\n- [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) - For increased survivability (if you don't have enough cash for a purple survival item above).\n\nAgainst certain annoying heroes:\n- [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) - Against Mei, Cassidy, Ashe, Ana, etc.\n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) - Against Genji on \"Melee\" build.",
